{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1000_p", "source_sha256": "366d009ce39b31e10ad2d25dfc460fb96b628276301035b0993d22d75a8a69e3", "ja": "（新しい衣装が届いたので、育に試着をしてもらった。\n楽曲に合わせてみたんだけど……育はどうかな？）", "zh": "（新服装送到了，就让育试穿了一下。配合歌曲试了试……育觉得怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "fa5870af2a53aa8bb20e744f4758842ce37b9add0889bc4fe3fb7520dd13b2f8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\n新しい衣装、着てみたよ！　どうかな？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我试穿了新服装！怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5a5854a4d70b878461697d19944d0f93aacca922147ddf6279dec9c3fd38c03", "ja": "おお！\n育によく似合ってて、とってもカッコいいぞ！", "zh": "哦！\n很适合育，特别帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "a6bbf3404cc32d2978539d4a463fa22d30dbd4bd7952c4e98e5c6758ffa345c3", "ja": "ありがとう♪　なんだかパレードの人みたいで、\nステキだよね。わたし、ワクワクが止まらないんだ！", "zh": "谢谢♪ 感觉就像游行队伍里的人一样，\n很漂亮吧。我真是兴奋得停不下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1004_p", "source_sha256": "05ecab7ec7d1f9d8039f6f95c2290f03bf4030cb664cf9169a86edd25f79bcd7", "ja": "そうか。育が気に入ったみたいで、よかったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。育好像很喜欢，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "edef6d7c34e85abc8d1aabcd1943fd233c794118c98e831359c363d21445e76a", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん？　あのね……\n長い棒とかおっきな旗とか持ってもいいかな？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生？我想问一下……  \n可以拿长棍子、大旗子之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1006_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee30483ea5b33deafe723a478f906cb8d6de6a9d94644d923248acdc4eeec919", "ja": "だってパレードの一番前にいる人は、\n長い棒で列を操ったりするでしょ？", "zh": "因为走在游行最前面的人，\n不是会用长杆指挥队伍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "09f04d27af6f676f3754f835fe96ed02dea800d19d65a9c87b8a2d1b57599ba0", "ja": "旗の人たちも、大きな旗をいーっぱい回してるよね？\nだからわたしも、パレードの人をやってみたい！", "zh": "举旗子的人也会把大大的旗子转来转去，对吧？\n所以我也想试试看当游行队伍的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1009_p", "source_sha256": "20d93606325144d453b4ad7952f21fa6153d04987c228e7160177fac481f70de", "ja": "なるほど……指揮棒やフラッグってことか。\nたしかに、今のままじゃ物足りないかもな……。", "zh": "原来如此……你是说指挥棒和旗帜啊。  \n确实，照现在这样可能有点不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "842dfe9d47ba78c4caf88a9d328822e5d17e3229ed14fb0fced96c472552b05a", "ja": "うん、そうだよ！　この衣装を着て、\nいつか、ステキなパレードがしてみたいなぁ。", "zh": "嗯，就是这样！好想总有一天\n能穿着这套服装，来一场精彩的游行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dad30685c290f69e89d8c66026f63831edd9463394c3448cd93806a2d69877de", "ja": "ステキなパレード、か……。\nなあ、育？　ひとつ提案があるんだ。", "zh": "精彩的游行啊……  \n那个，育？我有个提议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "2f213d264a625d731aa274af8928bd031d8628c31a2343634b18cc42cbd72f80", "ja": "ていあん？", "zh": "提议？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1013_p", "source_sha256": "82cb62364a28e4c2c709ee16381ab8e5bc1b711433d1e7fe12ba9d3b2de131ab", "ja": "ああ。もし育がよければ、\nその衣装のまま、劇場の中を歩いてみないか？", "zh": "啊。如果育不介意的话，要不要就穿着那身服装，在剧场里走一走？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "3734151f2742d9dc285599fd82352c8803422103607ae7cf4d4646bb0157d226", "ja": "……劇場を歩くの？\nそれって、みんなに衣装を見せにいくってこと？", "zh": "……在剧场里走？\n那是说，要去给大家看这身服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1015_p", "source_sha256": "febe04b99f6b5089fa2055f2c0c99a9f27e2ad1a24ecc310515b62e6c0b13f4a", "ja": "たしかに、そう見えるな。でもさっき言っただろう？\n「ステキなパレードがしてみたい」って。", "zh": "确实，看起来是这样。不过我刚才不是说过了吗？\n“想举办一场精彩的游行。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "88ef0e297293200440169638ad91605378e368dee85dee871f313e60a9b02091", "ja": "うん、言ったけど……あっ！\nそれじゃ、劇場のみんなとパレードするってこと？", "zh": "嗯，我是说过……啊！\n也就是说，要和剧场的大家一起参加游行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0166a5b3a510d847d5990b8dc85666206a9ea69e7d257c57559bd467eb8a51f2", "ja": "そうだよ。……といっても、\nみんなが参加するかは育の頑張り次第だ。どうかな？", "zh": "就是这样。……不过，\n大家会不会参加，就要看育的努力了。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "5731d4c8d2806cce72adb3ab38454d49c4d5490abd76f453b2aa625245b7ff43", "ja": "やってみたい！　みんなが「ついていきたい」って思う\n一番前の人！　わたし、いっぱいがんばるね♪", "zh": "我想试试！成为让大家都觉得“想跟着走”的领头人！我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ec6e1baf63ec749f5a434b97e62ff5f1256c61d46c2866a23d85573a82e7d028", "ja": "ああ！　育が頑張れるように、俺も手伝うぞ。", "zh": "啊！为了让育能好好努力，我也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "19cbfde5ba3d26484ea96eb9ac4b992e1f226896a522881cf8e9e43c37564774", "ja": "ありがとう！　それじゃ{$P$}さんは\nわたしの後ろについてきてね♪", "zh": "谢谢你！那{$P$}先生就\n跟在我的后面哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "bc2cecadb4a06d586bf70d863d5e761f77dcbe3f01c3e7a5689bc51d275d461a", "ja": "今は小さな行進だけど……劇場のみんなが参加したら\nとっても楽しいパレードになると思うんだ！", "zh": "虽然现在只是一场小小的游行……但要是剧场里的大家都参加进来，我觉得一定会变成非常开心的游行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "d06558f2fdae5635208caea0f485088c40d8b9153c9025d723abf6c06f502204", "ja": "{$P$}さん、遅れちゃダメだよ？\nそれじゃあ、しゅっぱ～つ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，可不能掉队哦？\n那么，出～发♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0384_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3355eb0447f0a8b1b9fb03e2a2c1d9b47c762a6ab6dc339f8117fb92f79b3ecb", "ja": "（育の呼びかけでアイドルたちが加わり……劇場を\n一周する頃には、賑やかなパレードが出来上がった！）", "zh": "（在育的呼唤下，偶像们也加入了进来……绕剧场一周时，已经组成了一支热闹的游行队伍！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
